      <title>江苏小学家长群接龙自费换桌椅，学校称纯属自主行为</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260905/%E6%B1%9F%E8%8B%8F%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%A6%E5%AE%B6%E9%95%BF%E7%BE%A4%E6%8E%A5%E9%BE%99%E8%87%AA%E8%B4%B9%E6%8D%A2%E6%A1%8C%E6%A4%85%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E7%A7%B0%E7%BA%AF%E5%B1%9E%E8%87%AA%E4%B8%BB%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
